{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3rtJjexJtZLk0gz7xbOUXA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:04.730262+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3rtJjexJtZLk0gz7xbOUXA","html":"<div><h1><span><br/></span></h1><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Ljib4So7yuWia146ud9Fic1b37gxVe4iaiaAF6icW47406tbsLpzEGOSJrD4fsVITn0DrflH8Sibd4yeWHqeaYsS5LHmA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Ljib4So7yuWia146ud9Fic1b37gxVe4iaiaAF6icW47406tbsLpzEGOSJrD4fsVITn0DrflH8Sibd4yeWHqeaYsS5LHmA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><span>北京计算科学研究中心（以下简称为中心）是中国工程物理研究院设立的以计算科学为牵引的多学科基础研究机构。为增进优秀大学生对中心的了解，促进不同院校间的学术交流与沟通，让同学们更好的感受和了解的中心文化及开放的科研状态，选拔一批心怀科研理想、具备优秀潜质的同学开启探索科研的道路，北京计算科学研究中心2026年暑期夏令营活动现启动报名！</span></section><section><span>中心将于2026年7月13日-7月15日线下举办“2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动”，活动期间, 将进行专业介绍、研究生座谈、研究部参观以及与老师近距离交流互动等安排。</span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/3pvGlEAh8kKutjqMLJKmeL24SZ6W8tpdlnaxOsuLUzlK1XWCkQ2dX6wOiahD62ich5GBuyTuonic9EKnPLcjFqmDg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>01</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>报名时间：即日起至6月30</span></span><span><span>日中午12:00。</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>将于7月初以短信或邮件方式通知入营同学及具体安排。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>02</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1、</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>生</span></span></font><font><span><span>(2027</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>届毕业生</span></span></font><font><span><span>)，所学专业与中心招生专业相关；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>2、学习成绩优秀；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>3、具有浓厚的学术研究兴趣, 有志于从事科研工作；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>4、英语水平良好；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>5</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>、</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>遵纪守法，品德优良，学风端正，身心健康。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>03</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>注册中物院研究生院夏令营系统https://gsas.gscaep.ac.cn/logon。进入系统后请仔细查看申请须知，按要求如实填报并提交申请材料，申请材料主要包括： </span></span></p><section><span>1、学生证（封面页、带照片页、含学院专业信息页），身份证；</span></section><section><span>2、本科成绩单：前5个学期成绩单及院系排名证明（有院系教务公章或学校系统成绩单截屏；</span></section><section><span>3、英语水平证明材料：大学英语四、六级证书，托福、GRE、雅思等证书；</span></section><section><span>4、其他材料：能体现个人学习能力、科研实践情况、学术水平的材料；</span></section><section><span>5、身体健康情况告知说明及诚信承诺书（本人手写签字），模板系统内下载。</span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>04</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>中心简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><font><span><span>北京计算科学研究中心成立于</span></span></font><font><span><span>2009年8月，英文名称为 Beijing Computation</span></span></font><font><span><span>al Science Research Center（简称BCSRC/CSRC），隶属于中国工程物理研究院（简称中物院），主要研究领域为物理、材料、数学</span></span></font><font><span><span>和</span></span></font><font><span><span>力学等学科，拥有百万亿次</span></span></font><font><span><span>/秒量级的高性能计算集群。中心作为一个基础性、跨学科、开放式的综合研究平台，是中物院开展对外科学技术交流合作的桥梁和纽带，是高层次人才引进与培养的摇篮。中心致力于以基础科学为牵引，提升国防科技能力，为中物院科学发展注入创新活力。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>中心设有物理系统模拟、量子物理与量子信息、材料与能源、复杂系统、应用与计算数学、力学和计算方法</span></span></font><font><span><span>等</span></span></font><font><span><span>七个研究部。主要有凝聚态物理、理论物理、粒子物理与原子核物理、等离子体物理、计算数学、应用数学、流体力学</span></span></font><font><span><span>等</span></span></font><font><span><span>七个招生专业方向。</span></span></font><font><span><span>与众多国际知名科研机构签署了合作谅解备忘录</span></span></font><font><span><span>。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>中心坐落于北京市海淀区中关村软件园，与</span></span></font><font><span><span>颐和园</span></span></font><font><span><span>、</span></span></font><font><span><span>西山景区</span></span></font><font><span><span>相伴，</span></span></font><font><span><span>自然环境</span></span></font><font><span><span>宜人。中心拥有一支</span></span></font><font><span><span>优秀的研究生</span></span></font><font><span><span>导师队伍，</span></span></font><font><span><span>包括中国科学院</span></span></font><font><span><span>院士2</span></span></font><font><span><span>人</span></span></font><font><span><span>，</span></span></font><font><span><span>各类国家级人才</span></span></font><font><span><span>18</span></span></font><font><span><span>人</span></span></font><font><span><span>。</span></span></font><font><span><span>目前在岗</span></span></font><font><span><span>硕士生导师</span></span></font><font><span><span>18</span></span></font><font><span><span>人，博士生导师</span></span></font><font><span><span>16</span></span></font><font><span><span>人。导师详情请查看中心官网</span></span></font><font><span><span>(http://www.csrc.ac.cn)。</span></span></font></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icaKIp9INc3MlI9MHVpdvENoXzsAfYratZ24emBKv0IpvzoLsrAy2GnPgUXnY5enEktuB0jXroobYFtNBnlBbgQMVKRpsPoO4sgrJ4om6os4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>05</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖助学金</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>中心会提供相对较高的科研补助及奖学金，也为同学们提供了相应的助岗助研项目及各种隐形福利补贴政策等。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>硕士：最高可至2800元/月，</span></span><span><span><span>学业</span></span></span><span><span><span>奖学金</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>000</span></span></span><span><span><span>元</span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>000</span></span></span><span><span><span>元</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>博士：</span></span><span><span><span>最高</span></span></span><span><span><span>可</span></span></span><span><span><span>至</span></span></span><span><span><span>6200</span></span></span><span><span><span>元</span></span></span><span><span><span>/月</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>学业奖学金5000</span></span></span><span><span><span>元</span></span></span><span><span><span>-6000元</span></span></span><span><span><span>/年</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>优秀学生奖学金：8000元/年或15000元/年。</span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>06</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>科研生活</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>浓厚的科研氛围：中心邀请海内外知名专家进行报告、会议或沙龙活动，如百旺论坛（院士级别，每月一场）、国内外知名专家研讨会（每周至少两场）。</span></span><span><span>同时积极促进同学们参与国内外学科领域会议，并推荐优秀学生前往海内外知名高校或研究所进行科研访问。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icaKIp9INc3OyCSicK7b8C5kX2e2KRNNo6D3qXU1RlO9xHR7hr54ujdACCROZPwdSibraAB9Saa5R3A1uicice712WGNxQIujzbaoExU4jYtMSv8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>优越的科研配置：中心为每一位同学提供独立的办公位置及办公电子设备。每楼设置两个会议室、阳光走廊、咖啡角，方便大家进行学习、讨论。同时中心建有高质量图书馆、可视化机房等科研工作场所。<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/3pvGlEAh8kKutjqMLJKmeL24SZ6W8tpdxIOfk0xhOibVugx3KsOibTLwn28YTHiaaeaLnvF9A2EmecDrESiczCeSeQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span>丰富的课余生活：每年举办春游、秋游、羽毛球、乒乓球等各类比赛。也会组织中心队伍参与软件园体育赛事，如荧光夜跑、皮划艇赛事等。同时举办每周影院、节日抽奖等福利活动。</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/3pvGlEAh8kILac4vYP5YRicbdriccOjqpLAH01LUY9lHKiaU2CDBxpicVS1FNK5AsQicHZwiazdgg7zsp3SXE7UVicOhw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>07</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中心将为参营同学报销往返路费及住宿费用。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>08</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询电话</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>李老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：010-56981708</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：lyy@csrc.ac.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Ljib4So7yuWia146ud9Fic1b37gxVe4iaiaAF6icW47406tbsLpzEGOSJrD4fsVITn0DrflH8Sibd4yeWHqeaYsS5LHmA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>          铸国防基石，做民族脊梁！</span></span></p><p><span><span>欢迎同学们报名，我们在北京计算科学研究中心等你！</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"5b6808da05da5607a4d0cb55b846e0a2e6d9a1b3769bd821341385138e426bc6","textLength":1730,"sourceSha256":"d5c1bb568f25640183b54a08ba4ce9f91995f618605a75aef5925e0f0fb26b8b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-243ec2552d54b5b6a886","title":"2026年北京计算科学研究中心优秀大学生暑期夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:04.730262+00:00"}
